			(property "Description" "1.4W MONO CLASS-D AUDIO POWER AMPLIFIER\n\nThe TPA2005D1 is a 1.4-W high efficiency filter-free class-D audio power amplifier in a BGA, QFN, or MSOP package that requires only three external components.\n\nDatasheet: http://focus.ti.com/lit/ds/symlink/tpa2005d1.pdf\n\n• 1.4 W Into 8 ? From a 5V Supply at THD = 10% (Typ)\n• Maximum Battery Life and Minimum Heat\n• Efficiency With an 8-? Speaker: 84% at 400 mW, 79% at 100 mW\n• 2.8-mA Quiescent Current\n• 0.5-mA Shutdown Current\n• Ideal for Wireless or Cellular Handsets and PDAs\n• Capable of Driving an 8-? Speaker (2.5 V ? VDD ? 5.5 V) and a 4-? Speaker (2.5 V ? VDD ? 4.2 V)\n• Only Three External Components\n• Optimized PWM Output Stage Eliminates LC Output Filter\n• Internally Generated 250-kHz Switching Frequency Eliminates Capacitor and Resistor\n• Improved PSRR (-71 dB at 217 Hz) and Wide Supply Voltage (2.5 V to 5.5 V) Eliminates Need for a Voltage Regulator\n• Fully Differential Design Reduces RF Rectification and Eliminates Bypass Capacitor\n• Improved CMRR Eliminates Two Input Coupling Capacitors"
				(at 0 0 0)
				(show_name no)
				(do_not_autoplace no)
				(hide yes)
				(effects
					(font
						(size 1.27 1.27)
					)
				)
			)
